{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Manina 是一款為重視私隱的家長而設的育兒記錄 App，把餵奶、睡眠、尿布與成長里程碑集中在一處，全程無廣告、可離線使用，記錄只加密儲存在自己的裝置。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，適合想親手整理寶寶日常與成長回憶的父母。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-39.webp\">\n<h2>無廣告離線寶寶成長記錄</h2>\n<p>內建 25 種日常記錄，涵蓋餵奶、副食品、尿布、睡眠與疫苗，幾下點按即可完成。身高、體重與頭圍可對照世界衛生組織標準，並估算成年身高趨勢。里程碑徽章與相片相簿留住每個第一次。記錄加密儲存於裝置，可用 Face ID 鎖定，並自行備份至雲端。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-101-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-102-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-103-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-104-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Manina: Baby Growth Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T08:22:29.557516+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T08:11:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T11:17:58.794530+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:17:43.188329+00:00","content_hash":"d4de35a083e7c1948c046fe42eebd0e736601279e6b3fe1d9a5d35b6e04453b8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}